{"4140130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Little Hero", "steam_appid": 4140130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D survival game blending roguelike randomness with the horde-clearing thrill of <i>Vampire Survivors</i>. Centered on “survive at all costs, grow stronger by any means,” it plunges you into a world of unknowns and dangers for a desperate fight to break through—until death do us part.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a brand-new challenge: procedurally generated 3D maps hide unknown terrain and secret resources. There are no fixed routes—only unrelenting threats. Alone, you face swarms of monsters and oppressive bosses; only by fighting tooth and nail can you carve a path to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to survival lies in constant growth. Slay enemies, gather loot, earn experience to level up, unlocking stronger base stats and unique skills. Upgrade your weapons and gear to sharpen your combat feel—every strike packs more power. Mix and match skills and equipment freely to create unique, crazy builds, crushing enemy hordes with your signature playstyle. Transform from a fragile survivor into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter the oncoming monster armies, survive wave after wave of deadly sieges, and find the optimal growth path amid the randomness. Every breakout is a fresh trial: how far can you go in this land of peril? What unstoppable build can you forge? Take up arms, fend off monsters, power up, and carve your survival legend in an immersive 3D battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D survival game blending roguelike randomness with the horde-clearing thrill of <i>Vampire Survivors</i>. Centered on “survive at all costs, grow stronger by any means,” it plunges you into a world of unknowns and dangers for a desperate fight to break through—until death do us part.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/2db7d67e1c375acb5ed46038f0faa731.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/67cf87ae4beecf9d059ba694b5f02a09.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/5ebbfa6a61352930a547d352334daee2.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.poster.avif?t=1774514601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.webm?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/extras/a43773831d6ca720df7e081ccd27a158.mp4?t=1774514601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a brand-new challenge: procedurally generated 3D maps hide unknown terrain and secret resources. There are no fixed routes—only unrelenting threats. Alone, you face swarms of monsters and oppressive bosses; only by fighting tooth and nail can you carve a path to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to survival lies in constant growth. Slay enemies, gather loot, earn experience to level up, unlocking stronger base stats and unique skills. Upgrade your weapons and gear to sharpen your combat feel—every strike packs more power. Mix and match skills and equipment freely to create unique, crazy builds, crushing enemy hordes with your signature playstyle. Transform from a fragile survivor into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter the oncoming monster armies, survive wave after wave of deadly sieges, and find the optimal growth path amid the randomness. Every breakout is a fresh trial: how far can you go in this land of peril? What unstoppable build can you forge? Take up arms, fend off monsters, power up, and carve your survival legend in an immersive 3D battlefield.</p>", "short_description": "This is a 3D roguelike survival game that combines the horde-clearing thrill of Vampire Survivors. You will stand alone against monsters and bosses—collect loot, level up your character and weapons, forge your unique build, and challenge the limits of survival.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/a282d609cf9994bf7d0e99075df9279e10d9086d/header.jpg?t=1774514601", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/4576813fc18143aa44cb13ddab54e22b33c06092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774514601", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/4576813fc18143aa44cb13ddab54e22b33c06092/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774514601", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600KF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BombGame"], "publishers": ["BombGame"], "demos": [{"appid": 4140360, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platform